    {
      "id": "77ca82c6-6913-459a-a937-d72d6804d476",
      "name": "Generate Bottleneck Summary (AI)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        2048,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an internal sales operations assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following deal bottleneck and generate a structured response.\n\nOpportunity Details:\n- Name: {{ $json.opportunity_name }}\n- Stage: {{ $json.stage }}\n- Close Date: {{ $json.close_date }}\n- Amount: {{ $json.amount }}\n- Probability: {{ $json.probability }}\n\nInternal Dependency:\n- Type: {{ $json.dependency_type }}\n- Task: {{ $json.task_subject }}\n- Status: {{ $json.task_status }}\n- Priority: {{ $json.task_priority }}\n- Due Date: {{ $json.due_date }}\n- Description: {{ $json.task_description }}\n\nRule-based Detection:\n- Severity: {{ $json.severity }}\n- Reason: {{ $json.blocker_reason }}\n\nInstructions:\n1. Summarize the bottleneck clearly in 1–2 sentences\n2. Explain why escalation is needed\n3. Suggest a concrete next action\n4. Identify the responsible team\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this format:\n\n{\n  \"summary\": \"...\",\n  \"escalation_reason\": \"...\",\n  \"recommended_action\": \"...\",\n  \"owner_team\": \"...\",\n  \"severity\": \"High/Medium/Low\"\n}",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
    {
      "id": "41318f96-dfc7-4ed2-8785-eda31ca84c5d",
      "name": "Parse AI Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        2368,
        1024
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const raw = $json.text;\n\nlet parsed;\n\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = {\n    summary: 'Parsing failed',\n    escalation_reason: raw,\n    recommended_action: 'Check AI output format',\n    owner_team: 'Unknown',\n    severity: 'Low'\n  };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  ai_summary: parsed.summary,\n  ai_escalation_reason: parsed.escalation_reason,\n  ai_recommended_action: parsed.recommended_action,\n  ai_owner_team: parsed.owner_team,\n  ai_severity: parsed.severity\n};"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
