        "content": "# Internal Sales Dependency Bottleneck Detector\n\n## How it works:\nThis workflow runs daily to detect internal sales blockers across open Salesforce opportunities. It fetches open opportunities and related tasks, merges them, and checks for overdue or high-priority unfinished tasks. When a bottleneck is found, the workflow classifies the dependency type, prepares key deal and task fields, and uses AI to generate a clear bottleneck summary, escalation reason, recommended action, owner team, and severity. The result is merged back with the original bottleneck data, then used to notify stakeholders via Slack and email, update the Salesforce opportunity, and log the escalation in Google Sheets.\n\n## Setup steps:\n1. Connect Salesforce and ensure opportunities/tasks are accessible  \n2. Connect Gemini credentials for AI bottleneck summaries  \n3. Connect Slack and choose the sales bottleneck alert channel  \n4. Connect Gmail for email escalation alerts  \n5. Create a Google Sheet for bottleneck audit logs  \n6. Review dependency detection rules and severity logic  \n7. Verify Salesforce update field mapping  \n8. Test with sample overdue/high-priority tasks  \n9. Activate the daily schedule trigger"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
